    "text": "Using Compustat Segment data, sinAlgo is defined as a binary variable equal to 1 if at least one segment of a firm is listed as being in at least one of the following industries: sic $\\geq$ 2100 & sic $\\leq$ 2199, sic $\\geq$2080 & sic $\\leq$ 2085, NAICS in \\{7132, 71312, 713210, 71329, 713290, 72112, 721120\\}.",
